# Derived by hand from Type System ch. 2 ("Bundles") and Semantics ch. 8 ("A new place's first value": the `$` part's first value from the first-value query; "The patch": answers and pushes on two channels; a response is addressed by path, a state keyed by the element's value) and ch. 9 (`@Offline`: a supplier answers the bundle part by part, `never` for the event, a constant dynamic for the `$` part, read at the place's build).
